# Collector HTTP cache. Contains raw GitHub API responses about real people —
# profiles, repositories and pull requests of anyone this engine has scored or
# scouted. It is a working artifact, never a deliverable, and this repository
# is public. `*.db` did not cover it, which is how 1.6MB of cached API bodies
# came to be committed.
.cache/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
